body_en:
1. Xiaomi's first AI glasses released, supporting third-party app video calls and live streaming;
2. Alibaba: Building "AI+Cloud" as the core of its technology business to become Alibaba's second growth curve;
3. Google launches open-source AI programming tool Gemini CLI;
4. Huang Renxun says AI reasoning requires more computational power;
5. Anthropic announces Claude's new AI application building feature.
